# Company Employee Portal

## Project Overview

This project is a Django-based Employee Management System integrated with PostgreSQL.

## Features

- PostgreSQL Integration
- Employee Management
- Department Management
- Django ORM
- Django Admin Panel
- Employee Search and Filter

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Django
- PostgreSQL
- psycopg2-binary
- Git
- GitHub

## Installation

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python manage.py makemigrations
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py createsuperuser
python manage.py runserver
```

## Project Structure

```
company_portal/
├── company_portal/
├── employees/
├── manage.py
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md
```

